<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-800 mt-12 mb-4 leading-snug font-display border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 inline-block">Pricing for Luxury 4BHK Villas with Private Pool in Lonavala</h2>

<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-5">Premium 4BHK villas with private pools in Lonavala typically command higher rates compared to standard villas, reflecting the superior quality and exclusivity on offer. Weekday rates for luxury villas generally start from ₹18,000 to ₹30,000 per night. Weekend rates range from ₹28,000 to ₹55,000 per night, with peak season prices (Diwali, Christmas, New Year) reaching ₹60,000 to ₹80,000 per night at the most sought-after properties.</p>

