<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-800 mt-12 mb-4 leading-snug font-display border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 inline-block">Booking Tips for Luxury 4BHK Villas in Lonavala</h2>

<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-5">Always book directly with the villa operator rather than through third-party aggregators when possible — you'll often get better rates, more transparency, and better communication. Confirm all amenities in writing before paying, and ask for a detailed property checklist. Check cancellation policies carefully, especially if you're booking far in advance. Read recent guest reviews to verify the current condition and cleanliness standards of the property.</p>

